#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:4
msgid "Reason codes"
msgstr "原因码"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:6
msgid ""
"Every refusal, failure, wait and status line that ANet reports to a "
"person carries a *reason code* and one sentence. The command line, the "
"MCP tools, the local A2A interface, the control plane and the local "
"console take their sentences from one table, so the same event produces "
"the same code and the same words on every surface. This page lists that "
"table."
msgstr ""
"ANet 向用户报告的每一条拒绝、失败、等待和状态信息，都带有一个 *原因码* 和一句话。命令行、MCP 工具、本地 A2A "
"接口、控制平面和本地控制台从同一张表取得语句，因此同一事件在所有界面上产生相同的原因码和相同的文字。本页列出这张表。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:18
msgid "How a code is reported"
msgstr "原因码的报告方式"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:20
msgid ""
"A code is a lower-case identifier of at most 30 characters that matches "
"``[a-z][a-z0-9_]*``. Some rows have a *variant*; the row key is then the "
"code, a dot and the variant (for example "
"``delivery_unconfirmed.queued``). A variant changes the words of the "
"sentence and never the code."
msgstr ""
"原因码是小写标识符，最长 30 个字符，匹配 ``[a-z][a-z0-9_]*``\\ 。部分行带有 "
"*变体*；此时行键由原因码、一个点和变体组成（例如 "
"``delivery_unconfirmed.queued``）。变体只改变语句的措辞，不改变原因码。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:25
msgid "The same code appears in these places:"
msgstr "同一个原因码出现在以下位置："

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:27
msgid "``anet.reason``"
msgstr "``anet.reason``"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:28
msgid ""
"The metadata key of a task or of a single message in the local A2A "
"interface, the MCP task projection and the control plane."
msgstr "本地 A2A 接口、MCP 任务投影和控制平面中，任务或单条消息的元数据键。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:31
msgid "``reason``"
msgstr "``reason``"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:32
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The field of a control-plane error body. The body has the form "
"``{\"error\": \"...\", \"reason\": \"...\", \"next\": \"...\"}``. The "
"command line prints the ``error`` sentence followed by the code in "
"brackets on standard error and, when ``next`` is present, a second line "
"that begins with an arrow (``→``). It does not print the JSON body. See "
":ref:`reason-codes-shown`."
msgstr ""
"控制平面错误正文的字段。正文形如 ``{\"error\": \"...\", \"reason\": \"...\", \"next\": "
"\"...\"}``。命令行在标准错误上输出 ``error`` 语句，其后用方括号给出代码；若有 "
"``next``，再输出以箭头（``→``）开头的第二行。命令行不输出 JSON 正文。见 :ref:`reason-codes-shown`。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:38
msgid "``ErrorInfo``"
msgstr "``ErrorInfo``"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:39
msgid ""
"The details of an A2A error returned by the local interface. The "
"``details`` array holds two ``google.rpc.ErrorInfo`` entries. The first "
"has the domain ``a2a-protocol.org`` and the reason of the A2A error. The "
"second has the domain ``agentnetwork.org.cn``, an upper-case form of the "
"code as the reason, and the lower-case code in ``metadata.reason``."
msgstr ""
"本地接口返回的 A2A 错误的详情。\\ ``details`` 数组包含两个 ``google.rpc.ErrorInfo`` "
"条目。第一个的域为 ``a2a-protocol.org``，原因为该 A2A 错误的原因。第二个的域为 "
"``agentnetwork.org.cn``，原因为原因码的大写形式，小写的原因码位于 ``metadata.reason``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:45
msgid ""
"The sentence is rendered by the node. The language is English unless the "
"environment variable ``ANET_LANG`` of the node begins with ``zh`` (in any"
" letter case), which selects Chinese. Any other value, and an unset "
"variable, select English; ``LC_ALL``, ``LC_MESSAGES`` and ``LANG`` are "
"not consulted. Rows of the class that is read by the sandboxed agent (the"
" egress refusals) are English in both languages. Clients pass the "
"sentence on unchanged."
msgstr ""
"语句由节点生成。语言默认为英文；节点的环境变量 ``ANET_LANG`` 以 ``zh`` "
"开头（不区分大小写）时选择中文。其他值或未设置时选择英文；``LC_ALL``、``LC_MESSAGES`` 和 ``LANG`` "
"不再参与判断。由沙箱中的 agent 读取的那一类条目（出站拒绝）在两种语言下均为英文。客户端原样传递该语句。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A sentence is built from a template. Placeholders in braces, such as "
"``{aid}``, ``{peer}``, ``{task}``, ``{retry}`` and ``{limit}``, are "
"filled only from data that the node itself holds. Text written by a "
"remote peer never becomes part of a sentence. A placeholder without a "
"value is replaced by a neutral form; it is never printed as a brace "
"expression or left empty."
msgstr ""
"语句由模板生成。花括号中的占位符，例如 ``{aid}``\\ 、\\ ``{peer}``\\ 、\\ ``{task}``\\ 、\\ "
"``{retry}`` 和 "
"``{limit}``，只用节点自身持有的数据填充。远端对端写入的文本不会成为语句的一部分。没有值的占位符以中性形式替换；它不会以花括号表达式的形式输出，也不会留空。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:62
msgid "Where the code is shown"
msgstr "代码的显示位置"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:64
msgid ""
"A person who sees a refusal can name it by its code, and a script can "
"match on it."
msgstr "看到拒绝的人可以用代码指称它，脚本可以按代码匹配。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:67
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "命令行"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:68
msgid ""
"A refusal is printed on standard error as the sentence, a space and the "
"code in brackets on the same line, then the ``next`` line. For example::"
msgstr "拒绝在标准错误上输出：语句、一个空格、方括号中的代码，在同一行，然后是 ``next`` 行。例如："

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:74
msgid ""
"This applies to every refusal that the control plane answers with a "
"reason, to the refusals of ``anet agents wire`` and ``anet agents "
"unwire`` (the ``wire_`` codes), and to the refusals of ``anet hub-"
"register`` and ``anet hub-leave``. When the hub refused the request with "
"a code of its own, the line shows both: ``[hub_refused:<hub code>]``. The"
" hub codes are listed in :ref:`hub-api-codes`."
msgstr ""
"适用于控制平面带原因返回的每一个拒绝、``anet agents wire`` 和 ``anet agents unwire`` "
"的拒绝（``wire_`` 代码），以及 ``anet hub-register`` 和 ``anet hub-leave`` 的拒绝。hub "
"以自己的代码拒绝请求时，该行同时显示两者：``[hub_refused:<hub code>]``。hub 代码列在 :ref:`hub-api-"
"codes` 中。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:81
msgid "MCP tools"
msgstr "MCP 工具"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:82
msgid ""
"The text of a tool error is the sentence of the control plane followed by"
" the code in brackets, in the same form."
msgstr "工具错误的文本是控制平面的语句，其后以同样的形式用方括号给出代码。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:85
msgid "JSON"
msgstr "JSON"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:86
msgid ""
"Unchanged. The control-plane body, ``anet.reason`` and ``ErrorInfo`` "
"carry the code in their own fields, and the output of ``--json`` has no "
"bracketed suffix."
msgstr ""
"不变。控制平面正文、``anet.reason`` 和 ``ErrorInfo`` 在各自的字段中携带代码，``--json`` "
"的输出没有方括号后缀。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:90
msgid "Diagnostic report"
msgstr "诊断报告"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:91
msgid ""
"``anet doctor`` keeps its own format, which already shows the reason of "
"each check."
msgstr "``anet doctor`` 保持自己的格式，它已经显示每项检查的原因。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:98
msgid "Code lifecycle"
msgstr "代码的生命周期"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:100
msgid ""
"A reason code is a stable interface. Scripts, agents and operators rely "
"on it, so the following rules hold for every code."
msgstr "原因码是稳定的接口。脚本、代理和运维人员依赖它，因此每个代码都遵守以下规则。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:103
msgid ""
"The meaning of a code never changes. A sentence may be reworded and a "
"variant may be added, but the event that the code names stays the same."
msgstr "代码的含义不会改变。语句可以改写，也可以增加变体，但代码所指的事件保持不变。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:105
msgid "A code is never renamed. A different event has a different code."
msgstr "代码不会被改名。不同的事件使用不同的代码。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:106
msgid "A code is never reused. When a code is retired, its name stays reserved."
msgstr "代码不会被复用。代码停用后，其名称继续保留。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:107
msgid ""
"A retired code stays on this page, in :ref:`reason-codes-retired`, with "
"the version that retired it and, when there is one, the code that "
"replaces it."
msgstr "已停用的代码保留在本页的 :ref:`reason-codes-retired` 中，并注明停用它的版本，以及（如有）替代它的代码。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:109
msgid "New and retired codes are announced in the release notes (:doc:`../news`)."
msgstr "新增和停用的代码在发布说明（:doc:`../news`）中公布。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:110
msgid ""
"A script matches on the code, never on the sentence. Sentences are "
"rewritten between releases and differ between English and Chinese."
msgstr "脚本按代码匹配，不按语句匹配。语句会在版本之间改写，并且英文与中文不同。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:113
msgid ""
"The *Since* column of the tables gives the first version of ``anet`` that"
" emitted the code. The register of every code ever published is the file "
"``internal/a2ashape/codes.txt`` in the source; a test holds it against "
"the reason table, so a code cannot be added, removed or reused without a "
"deliberate change to the register. The procedure is in "
":doc:`../contributing`."
msgstr ""
"表格的 *Since* 列给出首次输出该代码的 ``anet`` 版本。已发布的全部代码登记在源码的 "
"``internal/a2ashape/codes.txt`` "
"中，测试把它与原因表对照，因此不经有意修改登记表，就无法增加、删除或复用代码。流程见 :doc:`../contributing`。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:119
msgid ""
"Every code has an anchor of the form ``reason-code-<code>``, with each "
"underscore of the code replaced by a hyphen: the code ``busy`` is "
"``reason-code-busy`` and ``hub_refused`` is ``reason-code-hub-refused``. "
"A page can link to a code with the role ``ref`` and the label ``reason-"
"code-busy``, and a browser can open ``reason-codes.html#reason-code-"
"busy``."
msgstr ""
"每个代码都有形如 ``reason-code-<code>`` 的锚点，代码中的每个下划线替换为连字符：代码 ``busy`` 的锚点是 "
"``reason-code-busy``，``hub_refused`` 的锚点是 ``reason-code-hub-"
"refused``。页面可以用角色 ``ref`` 和标签 ``reason-code-busy`` 链接到某个代码，浏览器可以打开 "
"``reason-codes.html#reason-code-busy``。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:127
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "原因码的类"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:129
msgid ""
"The *Class* column of the tables names where a sentence appears and how "
"A2A carries it."
msgstr "各表的 *类* 列说明语句出现在何处，以及 A2A 如何承载该语句。"

