#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:183
msgid ""
"The *Next step* column names what the sentence asks of the reader. "
"``command`` rows give the command, with its placeholders. The other "
"values are ``none needed``, ``auto`` (the node is handling the matter), "
"``retry later``, ``change input`` (change the request, an argument, a "
"file or the condition of the node, then repeat), ``contact`` (ask the "
"other side or an operator), ``start over`` (create a new task) and "
"``futile`` (repeating the request does not help)."
msgstr ""
"各表的 *下一步* 列说明语句要求读者做什么。\\ ``command`` 行给出命令及其占位符。其他取值为 ``none needed``\\ "
"、\\ ``auto``\\ （节点正在处理该事项）、\\ ``retry later``\\ 、\\ ``change input``\\ "
"（修改请求、参数、文件或节点的状况，然后重试）、\\ ``contact``\\ （询问对方或运营人员）、\\ ``start over``\\ "
"（创建新任务）和 ``futile``\\ （重复该请求无济于事）。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:193
msgid "Codes that are not shown"
msgstr "不显示的原因码"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:195
msgid ""
"Some conditions are handled by the node and have no sentence: an expired "
"hub session that the daemon reopens, a stale encryption key identifier "
"that the outbound engine re-wraps, replayed or stale request timestamps "
"that the daemon signs again, and the many lower-case, hyphenated "
"rejection counters of the sealed-envelope layer. These are counted and "
"written to the log. They do not appear in ``anet.reason``, in a control-"
"plane ``reason`` or in an ``ErrorInfo``."
msgstr ""
"部分状况由节点自行处理，没有语句：守护进程重新打开的已过期 hub "
"会话、出站引擎重新封装的过期加密密钥标识符、守护进程重新签名的重放或过期的请求时间戳，以及密封信封层大量以小写字母和连字符命名的拒绝计数器。这些情况会被计数并写入日志，不出现在"
" ``anet.reason``\\ 、控制平面的 ``reason`` 或 ``ErrorInfo`` 中。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:202
msgid ""
"Rejections of the ANetLink C1 interface are mapped to user codes and are "
"not exposed: ``not_permitted`` is reported as ``provider_policy``, "
"``unknown_capability`` and ``not_found`` as ``capability_not_served``, "
"``too_large`` as ``args_too_large``, and ``bad_request``, "
"``unsupported_media``, ``internal`` and ``c1_version`` as "
"``backend_failed``."
msgstr ""
"ANetLink C1 接口的拒绝会映射为用户原因码，不对外暴露：``not_permitted`` 报告为 "
"``provider_policy``，``unknown_capability`` 和 ``not_found`` 报告为 "
"``capability_not_served``，``too_large`` 报告为 "
"``args_too_large``，``bad_request``\\ 、\\ ``unsupported_media``\\ 、\\ "
"``internal`` 和 ``c1_version`` 报告为 ``backend_failed``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:210
msgid "The table"
msgstr "原因码表"

#: ../../reference/reason-codes.rst:212
msgid ""
"The tables are generated from the reason table and the code register in "
"the ANet source by ``docs/_tools/gen_reason_codes.py``. Each sentence is "
"given in English and in Chinese. Both are the exact text that the node "
"prints. The *Since* column is empty for a row that is a sentence key and "
"not a code (a dotted key)."
msgstr ""
"表格由 ANet 源码中的原因表和代码登记表经 ``docs/_tools/gen_reason_codes.py`` "
"生成。每个语句同时给出英文和中文，二者都是节点输出的原文。对于只是语句键而不是代码的行（带点号的键），*Since* 列为空。"

#: ../../reference/_generated/reason-codes.inc:8
msgid "Refused on receipt"
msgstr "收到时被拒绝"

#: ../../reference/_generated/reason-codes.inc:10
msgid ""
"The other side refused the message when it arrived. The reason travels "
"back with the delivery confirmation."
msgstr "对方在消息到达时拒绝了该消息。原因随送达确认一并返回。"

